  - m_Id: 525398139
    m_Key: Advance to GO. Collect $200.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398140
    m_Key: "Go shopping on the Champs-\xC9lys\xE9es. Advance there."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398141
    m_Key: Advance to Ginza. If you pass GO, collect $200.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398142
    m_Key: Advance to Lapa. If you pass GO, collect $200.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398143
    m_Key: Catch a train at Grand Central. If you pass GO, collect $200.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398144
    m_Key: All aboard! Advance to the nearest station. If it is owned, pay the owner twice the rent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398145
    m_Key: Advance to the nearest utility. If it is owned, roll the dice and pay the owner ten times the roll.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398146
    m_Key: Your travel blog goes viral. Collect $50.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398147
    m_Key: Get Out of Jail Free. Keep this card until you need it, or trade it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398148
    m_Key: Wrong turn! Go back three spaces.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398149
    m_Key: Go to Jail. Move directly to Jail. Do not pass GO, do not collect $200.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398150
    m_Key: Your hotels need a makeover. Pay $25 for each house and $100 for each hotel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398151
    m_Key: Speeding ticket on the autobahn. Pay $15.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398152
    m_Key: You treat the whole tour group to dinner. Pay each player $50.
    m_Metadata:
