    m_Key: Your travel savings mature. Collect $150.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398154
    m_Key: Hitch a ride to Free Parking. Advance there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398155
    m_Key: Robin Hood! The richest player pays you $100.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398156
    m_Key: Tailwind! Move forward five spaces.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398157
    m_Key: The bank made a mistake in your favor. Collect $200.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398158
    m_Key: Travel insurance co-payment. Pay $50.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398159
    m_Key: You sell your holiday photos. Collect $50.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525398160
    m_Key: Your holiday fund matures. Collect $100.
    m_Metadata:
